### docker-compose.yml (Arbitrum mainnet) ###

ARBITRUM_MAINNET_ETH_RPC_HOST=https://... # RPC archive node connection
ARBITRUM_MAINNET_ETH_WS_HOST=wss://... # websocket archive node connection

### docker-compose-dev.yml (Arbitrum Sepolia testnet) ###

# ARBITRUM_SEPOLIA_ETH_RPC_HOST=https://... # RPC archive node connection
# ARBITRUM_SEPOLIA_ETH_WS_HOST=wss://... # websocket archive node connection

### optional configuration ###

## create database indexes on startup (default false when unset in docker compose)
CREATE_INDEX=true
